Data Dictionary
The project integrates Walmart-style retail sales data at store, department and date level with supporting store and external-factor datasets.
Sales Data
Field	Description
Store	Store identifier
Dept	Department identifier
Date	Weekly sales date
Weekly_Sales	Weekly sales amount
IsHoliday	Holiday-period indicator
Store Data
Field	Description
Store	Store identifier
Type	Store type/classification
Size	Store size
External Factors
Field	Description
Store	Store identifier
Date	Observation date
Temperature	Recorded temperature
Fuel_Price	Fuel price
CPI	Consumer Price Index
Unemployment	Unemployment rate
MarkDown fields	Promotional/markdown measures where available
Data Grain
The primary sales grain is:
Store × Department × Week
The exact source schema should be retained when importing the original files.
